ious Shot</a>\n</td><td>15\n</td><td>varies\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Deals Poison damage\n</td><td>Range + AoE\n</td><td>Ranged\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td>15\n</td><td>Offensive\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Poison-shot.png\" title=\"Image:Poison-shot.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Poison-shot.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Poison-shot.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Poison_Shot\" title=\"Poison Shot\">Poison Shot</a>\n</td><td>20\n</td><td>varies\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Deals Poison damage over time\n</td><td>Range\n</td><td>Ranged\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td>3\n</td><td>Offensive\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Putrid-penetration.png\" title=\"Image:Putrid-penetration.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Putrid-penetration.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"42\" src=\"/images/recovered/Putrid-penetration.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Putrid_Penetration\" title=\"Putrid Penetration\">Putrid Penetration</a>\n</td><td>16\n</td><td>10\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">Deals Poison damage, chance to knock down\n</td><td>Range + Penetrate\n</td><td>Ranged\n</td><td>Poison\n</td><td>25\n</td><td>Offensive\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Average-bmi.png\" title=\"Image:Average-bmi.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Average-bmi.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/images/recovered/Average-bmi.png\" width=\"43\"/></a>\n</td><td><a href=\"/wiki/Average_BMI\" title=\"Average BMI\">Average BMI</a>\n</td><td>1\n</td><td>N/A\n</td><td style=\"text-align:left\">+10% Health per END, +5 AGI and END, -5% Mana per INT, -5 STR and INT\n</td><td>N/A\n</td><td>No\n</td><td>N/A\n</td><td>1\n</td><td>Passive\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/recovered/Extra-crispy-monster-bait.png\" title=\"Image:Extra-crispy-monster-bait.jpg\"><img alt=\"Image:Extra-crispy-monster-bait.jpg\" border=\"0\" height=\"43\" src=\"/